# 0902 진행할 것 — 백필 전제 검증

접속: `db-ro.gymboxx.prod.supp.kr` (gymboxx-prod-replica-01, 읽기 전용)
개발 DB 는 이름이 바뀌었다: `gymboxx-dev` → `dev-gymboxx-rds.cxubxpnokvfs.ap-northeast-2.rds.amazonaws.com`

## 1. duration_second 백필 계수 — count 가 분인가 초인가

`### 진행할 것` 은 "분" 전제이고 백필은 `count * 60` 이다.
판정: avg 가 5~60 이면 **분**(×60), 60~3600 이면 **초**(×1).

```sql
select
  count(*)            as rows_total,
  min(sh.count)       as min_count,
  round(avg(sh.count),1) as avg_count,
  max(sh.count)       as max_count,
  sum(sh.count > 300) as over_300,
  sum(sh.count <= 60) as under_60
from user_exercise_set_history sh
join user_exercise_session_history sess on sess.id = sh.user_exercise_session_history_id
join exercise e on e.id = sess.exercise_id
where e.unit = 'MINUTE';
```

### 분포 상세 (혼재 여부 확인)
결과: count는 초다.
```sql
select
  case
    when sh.count <= 60   then 'a. 1~60 (분 추정)'
    when sh.count <= 300  then 'b. 61~300 (모호)'
    else                       'c. 301+ (초 추정)'
  end as bucket,
  count(*) as rows,
  round(avg(sh.count),1) as avg_count
from user_exercise_set_history sh
join user_exercise_session_history sess on sess.id = sh.user_exercise_session_history_id
join exercise e on e.id = sess.exercise_id
where e.unit = 'MINUTE'
group by bucket
order by bucket;
```

### 종목별 (종목마다 단위가 다른지)

```sql
SELECT
    e.name,
    e.unit,
    COUNT(*) AS row_count,
    MIN(sh.count) AS min_c,
    ROUND(AVG(sh.count), 1) AS avg_c,
    MAX(sh.count) AS max_c
FROM user_exercise_set_history sh
JOIN user_exercise_session_history sess
    ON sess.id = sh.user_exercise_session_history_id
JOIN exercise e
    ON e.id = sess.exercise_id
WHERE e.unit = 'MINUTE'
GROUP BY e.id, e.name, e.unit
ORDER BY row_count DESC;
```
