## 2. weight_role 백필 대상 행 수

`has_weight = 1` 전건 `LOAD`. ASSIST 는 이번에 부여하지 않는다.

```sql
select has_weight, unit, status, count(*) as exercises
from exercise
group by has_weight, unit, status
order by has_weight desc, unit, status;
```
--- result ---
+------------+--------+----------+-----------+
| has_weight | unit   | status   | exercises |
+------------+--------+----------+-----------+
|          1 | SET    | ACTIVE   |       154 |
|          1 | SET    | INACTIVE |        33 |
|          0 | MINUTE | ACTIVE   |        23 |
|          0 | SET    | ACTIVE   |        59 |
|          0 | SET    | INACTIVE |         4 |
+------------+--------+----------+-----------+

### 어시스트 종목 검수 후보 (이름 기반, 참고용)

```sql
select id, name, unit, has_weight, status
from exercise
where name like '%어시스트%' or name like '%assist%'
   or name like '%보조%'
order by name;
```
--- result ---
+-----+----------------------------+------+------------+----------+
| id  | name                       | unit | has_weight | status   |
+-----+----------------------------+------+------------+----------+
| 235 | 머신 어시스트 딥스         | SET  |          1 | ACTIVE   |
|  79 | 머신 어시스트 친업         | SET  |          1 | INACTIVE |
| 234 | 머신 어시스트 풀업         | SET  |          1 | ACTIVE   |
+-----+----------------------------+------+------------+----------+
## 3. weight 단위 전제 — kg 로만 쌓였는지

`user_exercise_session_history.weight_type` 이 lb 인 집단의 무게 평균이
kg 집단의 2배 안팎이면 환산 백필을 다시 논의해야 한다.

```sql
select sess.weight_type,
       count(*) as sets,
       round(avg(sh.weight),2) as avg_weight,
       max(sh.weight) as max_weight
from user_exercise_set_history sh
join user_exercise_session_history sess on sess.id = sh.user_exercise_session_history_id
where sh.weight is not null and sh.weight > 0
group by sess.weight_type;
```
--- result ---
+-------------+--------+------------+-------------+
| weight_type | sets   | avg_weight | max_weight  |
+-------------+--------+------------+-------------+
| kg          | 324680 |      37.43 | 999.0000000 |
| lb          |  46649 |      33.30 | 226.7960000 |
+-------------+--------+------------+-------------+
## 4. 998 제거 전제 — cardio_intensity 에 값이 들어갔는지

값이 하나라도 있으면 제거 SQL 이 중단되어야 한다.
해당
```sql
select cardio_intensity, count(*) as exercises
from exercise
group by cardio_intensity;
```
--- result ---
ERROR 1054 (42S22) at line 1: Unknown column 'cardio_intensity' in 'field list'

### measure_type · axis 현황

```sql
select measure_type, count(*) as exercises from exercise group by measure_type;
```
-- result ---
ERROR 1054 (42S22) at line 1: Unknown column 'measure_type' in 'field list'

```sql
select axis, count(*) as body_parts from body_part group by axis;
```
--- result ---
ERROR 1054 (42S22) at line 1: Unknown column 'axis' in 'field list'
